@startuml UC62_ViewDashboard
!theme plain
title UC62: Xem dashboard

actor Staff as "Staff/Admin"
participant "Admin Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB

Staff -> Frontend: Truy cập trang Dashboard
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/bookings\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(populate guests, roomId, customerId)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role (staff/admin)
API -> DB: Query bookings\n(populate guests, roomId, customerId, services)
DB --> API: Bookings list

Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/invoices\n(Authorization: Bearer token)
API -> DB: Query invoices\n(populate bookingId, customerId)
DB --> API: Invoices list

Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/rooms\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(populate typeId)
API -> DB: Query rooms\n(populate typeId)
DB --> API: Rooms list

Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/notifications\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query: recent, limit)
API -> DB: Query notifications\n(filter: userId = currentUser hoặc role)\n(sort: createdAt desc, limit)
DB --> API: Recent notifications

Frontend -> Frontend: Tính toán thống kê\n(totalBookings, currentGuests, todayRevenue, monthRevenue, paidBookings, pendingBookings, paymentRate)

Frontend -> Frontend: Xác định việc cần làm\n(pending bookings, upcoming check-ins, overdue payments)

API --> Frontend: Success + data (bookings, invoices, rooms, notifications)
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị dashboard\n(tổng quan đặt phòng, công suất, thông báo gần đây, việc cần làm)
@enduml

